OL,3,GNEWSAFire involving 'a large amount of
OL,4,Atimber' breaks out
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are dealing with a blaze
OL,7,Fat a commercial premises after being
OL,8,Fcalled out in the early hours of the
OL,9,Fmorning.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fattended the site at Hallam Fields Road
OL,13,Fin Ilkeston, Derbyshire, at 01:44 BST
OL,14,Fon Wednesday following a 999 call.
OL,16,FThe service said the fire involved a
OL,17,Flarge amount of timber and was
OL,18,Fproducing a large plume of smoke.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
