OL,3,GNEWSAFire involving 'a large amount of
OL,4,Atimber' breaks out
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews managed to contain the fire
OL,7,Fovernight and will continue their
OL,8,Fefforts to extinguish it once daylight
OL,9,Fimproves conditions, with the service
OL,10,Fadvising people to avoid the area and
OL,11,Fnearby residents to keep windows and
OL,12,Fdoors closed.
